     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Isolde,<div><br></div><div>From your error it looks like you don&#39;t have enough RAM to allocate the vector it is trying to create when you use the experiment function. Have you tried running it in a computer with more RAM? I have this problem with my laptop quite frequently when I am dealing with too many rasters or high resolution ones.</div><div><br></div><div>Do you have your repo in github? If I can access it I can tell you with more certainty that this is the problem.</div><div><br></div><div>Tati</div></div>"
